 in place: a column’s member"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indices, or a vertex’s column indices ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IncidentHyperedgeIndices"},{"type":"text","text":"). No copy and no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"allocation, unlike a "},{"code":"BitSet","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". It shares the matrix’s words copy-on-write, so a later"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mutation of the matrix leaves it unchanged."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MemberIndices","kind":"identifier"}]}}}